{"time": 1755767685, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1663908117", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "903910689", "user_id": "2628755988"}, "sender": {"id": "2628755988", "name": "柒乔阪"}, "message": "“既然已经正式签下契约，我就开门见山地问了：贵方除了我们还遇到过其他主从么”"}
{"time": 1755767740, "type": "recv", "message_id": "147888859", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "903910689", "user_id": "458095233"}, "sender": {"id": "458095233", "name": "风铃浅唱"}, "message": "“不，还完全没有遇到过。只不过我们在大学里有看到附着着魔力波动的水膜。”"}
{"time": 1755767818, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1229709821", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "903910689", "user_id": "2628755988"}, "sender": {"id": "2628755988", "name": "柒乔阪"}, "message": "“方便透露大概多久前见到的么”"}
{"time": 1755767900, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1352651035", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "903910689", "user_id": "458095233"}, "sender": {"id": "458095233", "name": "风铃浅唱"}, "message": "“那便大方地告知你们吧。在完成召唤的时候就注意到了，不知道是多久之前由谁设下的”"}
{"time": 1755767914, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1893123633", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "903910689", "user_id": "2628755988"}, "sender": {"id": "2628755988", "name": "柒乔阪"}, "message": "“看来有必要侦查了呢”"}
{"time": 1755767941, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1522128948", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "903910689", "user_id": "2628755988"}, "sender": {"id": "2628755988", "name": "柒乔阪"}, "message": "（要不就准备分头行动的时候夜鹿说自己不想走）"}
